Historical schemes of RegCM
===========================

The files of this directory are not compiled. They are kept for reference:
schemes that were part of the model and have been removed, as they were at
their removal, with the pieces of code of the model that served only them.

  mod_cu_kuo.F90           Anthes-Kuo cumulus (icup = 1), hydrostatic and
                           non hydrostatic cores only
  kuo_setup.F90            its setup in mod_params: heating profile twght,
                           moisture flux weights vqflx (vqrang = 5e-4),
                           level k700; with Kuo the hydrostatic core
                           skipped the vertical advection of water vapour
                           and tracers, the scheme used the vertical
                           moisture convergence as closure
  mod_cu_bm.F90            Betts-Miller cumulus (icup = 3), with cldefi in
                           the restart file
  model_cumulus_cloud.F90  convective cloud of Kuo and Betts-Miller
                           (mod_cu_common, option icumcloud)
  mod_micro_subex.F90      SUBEX large scale microphysics (ipptls = 1, Pal
                           et al. 2000), namelist group subexparam
  condtq.F90               its condensation step (mod_micro_interface),
                           called after the sum of the tendencies

The integer codes of the removed schemes are not reused: the namelist
selects the schemes by name (Share/mod_scheme_names.F90). The SUBEX cloud
fraction is still in the model, named Sundqvist
(Main/cloudlib/mod_cloud_sundqvist.F90).
